1
00:00:08,640 --> 00:00:11,040
♪Amid the sea of faces♪

2
00:00:11,040 --> 00:00:14,440
♪Our eyes meet by chance♪

3
00:00:14,440 --> 00:00:17,400
♪Through the restless years♪

4
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:20,960
♪Time suddenly slows♪

5
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:24,000
♪No vows need be made♪

6
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:26,760
♪Though seas and mountains lie ahead♪

7
00:00:27,560 --> 00:00:29,480
♪One glance says it all♪

8
00:00:29,480 --> 00:00:33,280
♪Beyond a thousand words♪

9
00:00:33,960 --> 00:00:37,480
♪With you by my side♪

10
00:00:37,480 --> 00:00:40,720
♪I dare brave a thousand trials♪

11
00:00:40,720 --> 00:00:44,000
♪Though mist may veil the road ahead♪

12
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:47,280
♪Hand in hand, no counting years♪

13
00:00:47,280 --> 00:00:50,560
♪With you by my side♪

14
00:00:50,560 --> 00:00:54,000
♪No need to speak my heart at length♪

15
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:57,320
♪As rivers and mountains change♪

16
00:00:57,320 --> 00:00:59,400
♪May we remain together♪

17
00:00:59,400 --> 00:01:03,040
♪From dawn to dusk♪

18
00:01:03,040 --> 00:01:07,000
=Daughter of a Concubine=

19
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:09,920
=Episode 9=

20
00:01:10,400 --> 00:01:12,920
(Xia Residence)

21
00:01:12,920 --> 00:01:14,040
(Memorial tablet of Liu Rumei)

22
00:01:14,040 --> 00:01:15,040
Mother.

23
00:01:15,040 --> 00:01:16,920
She just placed that tablet
in our main hall.

24
00:01:17,120 --> 00:01:18,480
I can't swallow this!

25
00:01:20,159 --> 00:01:23,239
Xia Yunyi is getting bolder by the day.

26
00:01:23,920 --> 00:01:26,200
And she has Cheng Mingzhi backing her.

27
00:01:26,599 --> 00:01:27,799
If we let her stay,

28
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:29,760
she'll come after us sooner or later.

29
00:01:29,840 --> 00:01:31,280
What should we do, Mother?

30
00:01:34,239 --> 00:01:35,680
What did you think

31
00:01:36,120 --> 00:01:38,920
of the Cheng family's
second young master

32
00:01:39,359 --> 00:01:40,959
who visited us that day?

33
00:01:47,239 --> 00:01:50,159
You mean Cheng Xiao?

34
00:01:50,159 --> 00:01:51,200
What?

35
00:01:51,680 --> 00:01:52,680
Have you taken a liking to him?

36
00:01:53,719 --> 00:01:55,159
What nonsense, Mother.

37
00:01:56,159 --> 00:01:58,239
Even that woman can marry into
General's household.

38
00:01:58,280 --> 00:01:59,760
Why shouldn't you?

39
00:02:00,359 --> 00:02:02,000
Marry into the Cheng family,

40
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:05,200
and you'll outrank her
as her elder sister.

41
00:02:06,920 --> 00:02:10,599
I've sent a letter to Zhou Lanxin,
Second Madam of the Cheng family,

42
00:02:11,039 --> 00:02:12,719
proposing a marriage
between you and Cheng Xiao.

43
00:02:13,479 --> 00:02:14,680
Really?

44
00:02:15,680 --> 00:02:16,719
So soon?

45
00:02:16,879 --> 00:02:19,520
He may be the Cheng family's
second young master,

46
00:02:19,560 --> 00:02:21,960
but Cheng Mingzhi is always off at war.

47
00:02:22,280 --> 00:02:24,919
Who knows if he'll ever make it back?

48
00:02:25,360 --> 00:02:27,639
Zhou Lanxin is in charge now.

49
00:02:28,199 --> 00:02:29,199
The Cheng family

50
00:02:31,039 --> 00:02:33,400
will belong to her and Cheng Xiao soon.

51
00:02:34,039 --> 00:02:35,639
Once you're married into the family,

52
00:02:35,840 --> 00:02:38,400
Xia Yunyi won't have a moment's peace.

53
00:02:39,400 --> 00:02:40,360
Yunshu,

54
00:02:41,680 --> 00:02:42,919
when that happens,

55
00:02:42,919 --> 00:02:44,719
you'll both be part of the Cheng family.

56
00:02:45,280 --> 00:02:47,639
You can deal with her
however you see fit.

57
00:02:48,759 --> 00:02:49,560
Yunshu,

58
00:02:50,319 --> 00:02:53,039
I'll be counting on you.

59
00:02:53,800 --> 00:02:54,319
Mother,

60
00:02:54,520 --> 00:02:55,319
I will handle it!

61
00:03:05,160 --> 00:03:06,960
(Memorial tablet of Liu Rumei)

62
00:03:15,640 --> 00:03:17,680
(Double Happiness)

63
00:03:17,680 --> 00:03:19,560
(A Legacy of Loyalty and Courage)

64
00:03:24,720 --> 00:03:29,440
(Cheng Residence)

65
00:03:45,560 --> 00:03:48,240
(Cheng Residence)

66
00:04:09,800 --> 00:04:10,879
Good girl.

67
00:04:11,159 --> 00:04:12,680
At last, you've arrived.

68
00:04:13,039 --> 00:04:14,280
From now on,

69
00:04:14,280 --> 00:04:16,439
you're Second Young Madam
of the Cheng family.

70
00:04:16,519 --> 00:04:17,720
If anyone dares bully you,

71
00:04:17,720 --> 00:04:18,959
they'll have me to answer to.

72
00:04:19,519 --> 00:04:20,519
Thank you, Mother.

73
00:04:31,639 --> 00:04:32,839
Yunyi.

74
00:04:32,839 --> 00:04:34,279
Fancy meeting you again.

75
00:04:34,519 --> 00:04:37,120
From now on, we're not just sisters,

76
00:04:37,319 --> 00:04:38,439
we're sisters-in-law, too.

77
00:04:38,639 --> 00:04:40,040
You're right, Yunshu.

78
00:04:45,040 --> 00:04:46,120
Miss Yunyi,

79
00:04:47,079 --> 00:04:50,120
she is up to no good.

80
00:04:50,680 --> 00:04:53,240
Then let's see
who's better at playing dirty.

81
00:04:55,800 --> 00:04:58,200
(Breeze Through the Greenery)

82
00:05:07,000 --> 00:05:09,600
(Double Happiness)

83
00:05:31,839 --> 00:05:32,639
My Lady,

84
00:05:33,279 --> 00:05:34,240
tonight,

85
00:05:35,079 --> 00:05:36,639
let's try something different.

86
00:05:37,720 --> 00:05:38,519
My Lord,

87
00:05:39,160 --> 00:05:40,279
what's this?

88
00:05:40,439 --> 00:05:41,680
Don't be scared.

89
00:05:42,920 --> 00:05:44,560
It's a Cheng family tradition.

90
00:05:44,800 --> 00:05:48,480
Every new bride has to go through this.

91
00:06:08,640 --> 00:06:11,920
(Double Happiness)

92
00:06:11,920 --> 00:06:16,680
(Breeze Through the Greenery)

93
00:06:21,920 --> 00:06:23,000
(A Legacy of Loyalty and Courage)
Get up.

94
00:06:23,120 --> 00:06:24,040
Thank you, Aunt.

95
00:06:28,759 --> 00:06:30,519
Aunt, please have some tea.

96
00:06:37,399 --> 00:06:38,519
Good girl.

97
00:06:44,519 --> 00:06:46,040
Mother, please have some tea.

98
00:06:46,040 --> 00:06:46,759
Good.

99
00:06:47,439 --> 00:06:48,759
We're family now.

100
00:06:54,199 --> 00:06:55,839
Fourth Uncle, please have some tea.

101
00:06:55,839 --> 00:06:56,720
Good.

102
00:06:57,639 --> 00:06:59,120
May you two have a happy life together.

103
00:07:15,319 --> 00:07:16,600
Brother, please have some tea.

104
00:07:33,040 --> 00:07:33,680
Yunyi.

105
00:07:33,879 --> 00:07:35,160
You joined the family before I did.

106
00:07:35,480 --> 00:07:37,160
I'll be counting on you
to look after me.

107
00:07:37,439 --> 00:07:38,639
Rest assured, Yunshu.

108
00:07:39,120 --> 00:07:41,399
I'll take good care of you.

109
00:07:49,920 --> 00:07:51,600
Second Young Madam is no pushover.

110
00:07:51,959 --> 00:07:53,199
Don't trust the tea.

111
00:07:54,360 --> 00:07:56,040
When will you serve me tea?

112
00:08:00,519 --> 00:08:01,639
All right.

113
00:08:02,519 --> 00:08:03,839
We're all family here.

114
00:08:04,160 --> 00:08:05,720
No need for all this formality.

115
00:08:06,040 --> 00:08:06,839
Yunyi,

116
00:08:07,240 --> 00:08:08,959
you haven't seen Yunshu in ages.

117
00:08:09,240 --> 00:08:10,560
Take her for a walk.

118
00:08:10,560 --> 00:08:11,959
Have a nice chat.

119
00:08:13,600 --> 00:08:14,839
Yes, Mother.

120
00:08:15,040 --> 00:08:16,439
Yunyi, let me help you.

121
00:08:16,439 --> 00:08:17,680
No need. How kind of you.

122
00:08:18,199 --> 00:08:19,439
Given her eye condition,

123
00:08:19,439 --> 00:08:20,560
better let me help her.

124
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:23,720
Yunyi feels safer
with a familiar companion.

125
00:08:24,839 --> 00:08:27,160
Mingzhi, you're so considerate.

126
00:08:29,319 --> 00:08:30,120
Yunshu,

127
00:08:30,600 --> 00:08:32,080
you may lead the way.

128
00:08:32,279 --> 00:08:33,320
Watch your step.

129
00:08:34,279 --> 00:08:34,960
Got it.

130
00:08:38,840 --> 00:08:39,639
There's a step.

131
00:08:47,559 --> 00:08:49,159
The Cheng Residence is quite impressive.

132
00:08:49,840 --> 00:08:53,039
Too bad you can't see any of it, Yunyi.

133
00:08:53,799 --> 00:08:56,799
You didn't marry here
for the scenery, did you?

134
00:09:01,159 --> 00:09:03,200
Smell this. Recognize it?

135
00:09:06,559 --> 00:09:07,879
It's my mother's sachet.

136
00:09:09,799 --> 00:09:10,559
It's gone!

137
00:09:14,159 --> 00:09:15,120
What are you doing?

138
00:09:15,360 --> 00:09:16,279
What does it look like?

139
00:09:16,279 --> 00:09:17,919
Why would I keep
a dead woman's belonging?

140
00:09:18,000 --> 00:09:19,240
I threw it away, of course.

141
00:09:21,919 --> 00:09:25,360
Remember the pond
in the Xia Residence's backyard?

142
00:09:32,480 --> 00:09:33,519
(You little wretch,)

143
00:09:33,519 --> 00:09:34,720
(always screaming for help, huh?)

144
00:09:34,799 --> 00:09:35,879
(Go on! Scream!)

145
00:09:39,360 --> 00:09:41,879
You looked so "lovely" when you fell in.

146
00:09:42,639 --> 00:09:43,559
Oh, remember?

147
00:09:44,120 --> 00:09:47,000
That's when
you started losing your sight.

148
00:09:47,279 --> 00:09:48,360
Listen well,

149
00:09:48,440 --> 00:09:50,759
even if you married
into the Cheng family,

150
00:09:51,120 --> 00:09:53,039
you're still as lowly as your mother!

151
00:09:53,120 --> 00:09:54,519
Watch your tongue!

152
00:10:17,279 --> 00:10:18,440
Yunshu!

153
00:10:18,679 --> 00:10:21,679
I remember you can't swim either.

154
00:10:25,639 --> 00:10:26,480
My Lady!

155
00:10:27,320 --> 00:10:28,240
My Lady!

156
00:10:28,639 --> 00:10:29,639
My Lady!

157
00:10:29,639 --> 00:10:30,399
Yunshu!

158
00:10:30,399 --> 00:10:31,000
Yunshu!

159
00:10:31,000 --> 00:10:31,639
Help! Hurry!

160
00:10:31,840 --> 00:10:33,120
- Yunshu, are you all right?
- Hurry!

161
00:10:33,120 --> 00:10:34,039
Get over here, quick!

162
00:10:34,759 --> 00:10:35,360
Yunshu!

163
00:10:35,360 --> 00:10:36,200
Quick! Get her out!

164
00:10:36,200 --> 00:10:37,159
Are you all right, Yunshu?

165
00:10:37,159 --> 00:10:38,200
My Lady!

166
00:10:38,480 --> 00:10:39,000
Hurry!

167
00:10:39,000 --> 00:10:39,639
Come on!

168
00:10:39,639 --> 00:10:40,279
My Lady!

169
00:10:40,559 --> 00:10:41,080
My Lady!

170
00:10:41,360 --> 00:10:42,200
My Lady!

171
00:10:42,759 --> 00:10:43,440
Yunshu!

172
00:10:43,519 --> 00:10:44,320
Are you all right?

173
00:10:44,480 --> 00:10:45,120
It was her!

174
00:10:45,279 --> 00:10:47,279
That wretch pushed me in!

175
00:10:48,360 --> 00:10:49,480
Xia Yunyi!

176
00:10:49,480 --> 00:10:50,639
What do you think you're doing?

177
00:10:50,639 --> 00:10:51,039
Someone!

178
00:10:51,039 --> 00:10:52,120
What are you talking about?

179
00:11:00,200 --> 00:11:01,919
Second Young Madam slipped and fell in.

180
00:11:01,919 --> 00:11:02,960
She must be shaken up.

181
00:11:03,159 --> 00:11:05,000
It's no wonder
she's not thinking straight.

182
00:11:07,320 --> 00:11:07,799
But...

183
00:11:07,799 --> 00:11:08,639
But,

184
00:11:08,639 --> 00:11:10,759
you can't blame Yunyi without proof.

185
00:11:12,960 --> 00:11:14,279
This is a serious matter.

186
00:11:14,360 --> 00:11:16,039
It concerns Yunyi's reputation

187
00:11:16,039 --> 00:11:18,200
and the honor
of both the Cheng and Xia families.

188
00:11:21,200 --> 00:11:22,360
I say

189
00:11:22,360 --> 00:11:23,639
we should let this matter rest

190
00:11:23,639 --> 00:11:24,679
and keep it within the family.

191
00:11:24,919 --> 00:11:25,799
Cheng Xiao,

192
00:11:25,799 --> 00:11:27,559
take Yunshu back to rest.

193
00:11:34,279 --> 00:11:35,279
Let's go back.

194
00:11:35,720 --> 00:11:36,519
Come on!

195
00:11:44,679 --> 00:11:45,480
Yunyi,

196
00:11:45,600 --> 00:11:46,200
I'll go find the sachet.

197
00:11:46,200 --> 00:11:47,039
Xiaoxuan,

198
00:11:47,399 --> 00:11:48,200
it's fine.

199
00:11:52,879 --> 00:11:53,759
General.

200
00:11:54,000 --> 00:11:55,759
On our way back
from the Xia Residence that day,

201
00:11:55,960 --> 00:11:58,200
didn't you tell her that from then on,

202
00:11:58,200 --> 00:12:00,480
she could do as she pleased,
come what may?

203
00:12:00,759 --> 00:12:01,960
A gentleman always keeps his word.

204
00:12:01,960 --> 00:12:03,200
I'm no gentleman.

205
00:12:03,720 --> 00:12:04,759
I'm a general.

206
00:12:05,200 --> 00:12:06,600
How much longer?

207
00:12:08,840 --> 00:12:09,720
Is your job done?

208
00:12:09,720 --> 00:12:10,320
I'll get it done.

209
00:12:10,320 --> 00:12:10,840
Hurry up!

210
00:12:11,039 --> 00:12:12,039
Right away!

211
00:12:14,159 --> 00:12:15,440
What are they talking about?

212
00:12:16,919 --> 00:12:17,759
I have no idea.

213
00:12:19,559 --> 00:12:21,519
That wretched Xia Yunyi...

214
00:12:22,279 --> 00:12:24,320
First she dragged me to the well,

215
00:12:24,480 --> 00:12:25,919
now she's pushed you into the pond.

216
00:12:26,919 --> 00:12:28,360
Don't you think she can actually see?

217
00:12:33,279 --> 00:12:34,399
No, that's impossible.

218
00:12:34,639 --> 00:12:36,320
She's been blind for years
back in the Xia family.

219
00:12:36,360 --> 00:12:37,799
If she were faking it,
we would've noticed.

220
00:12:45,039 --> 00:12:46,039
Mother,

221
00:12:46,039 --> 00:12:47,360
I've got a plan.

222
00:13:14,000 --> 00:13:19,400
♪Let the past be buried in the wind♪

223
00:13:20,760 --> 00:13:25,480
♪Perhaps the waning moon knows my pain♪

224
00:13:25,940 --> 00:13:29,800
♪It sees the old tenderness
all come to nothing♪

225
00:13:29,800 --> 00:13:32,920
♪How many regrets haunt this world♪

226
00:13:32,920 --> 00:13:39,280
♪By the window, whose dreams flicker
by the dying candle♪

227
00:13:41,380 --> 00:13:45,880
♪Things remain, you're gone,
and I'm still dazed♪

228
00:13:47,000 --> 00:13:49,080
♪The sandstorm in my eyes♪

229
00:13:49,080 --> 00:13:52,600
♪Turns to a blade's edge♪
(Cheng Residence)

230
00:13:53,880 --> 00:13:55,160
♪Cutting through old years♪

231
00:13:55,160 --> 00:13:57,000
♪We can never embrace again♪

232
00:13:57,000 --> 00:14:02,400
♪If rain has tears,
wash away the dust of fate♪

233
00:14:02,560 --> 00:14:04,060
♪By lamplight, I turn the page♪

234
00:14:04,060 --> 00:14:07,160
♪The ink dries, and there you are♪

235
00:14:07,160 --> 00:14:09,000
♪Gone to ash in a flash♪

236
00:14:09,000 --> 00:14:10,800
♪Like a blade through my heart♪

237
00:14:10,800 --> 00:14:13,960
♪Too late to pull away♪

238
00:14:13,960 --> 00:14:16,640
♪The song ends, and all have gone♪

239
00:14:16,640 --> 00:14:20,880
♪Now we must part♪

240
00:14:20,880 --> 00:14:24,280
♪Flowers burn the ground,
yet vows are held so lightly♪

241
00:14:24,280 --> 00:14:28,280
♪The song ends.
Where shall I seek you in dreams♪

242
00:14:28,280 --> 00:14:30,320
♪By the window, a dying candle♪

243
00:14:30,320 --> 00:14:35,200
♪Whose shadow do I yearn for♪
